⚡🇪🇸🇷🇴  A Spanish F-18 fighter pilot on a NATO air policing mission shot down a drone that was illegally violating Romanian national airspace, the fourth unmanned aircraft shot down by the country this year, the Romanian Ministry of Defense stated.

The ministry did not specify the drone's origin, stating that its radars detected it entering the country from neighboring Moldova, about 24 km north of the Romanian southeastern city of Galati.

